        "Prior information notices"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Define > Market consultation and engagement",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation allows contracting authorities to notify the market of their intention to conduct future procurements through the publication of a prior information notice (PIN). Such notices must either be published in accordance with the requirements of regulation 51 PCR 2015 (publication on the UK e-notification service) or through publication on the contracting authority’s buyer profile in accordance with regulation 52 PCR 2015 (publication otherwise than on the UK e-notification service).",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The period covered by the prior information notice is a maximum of 12 months from the date on which the notice is transmitted for publication.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consider the appropriateness of engaging with suppliers through the publication of a PIN.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "consider the publication of a PIN as a means of maximising interest from the market in the future procurement opportunity",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that a PIN is advertised correctly, incorporating all relevant information required by this regulation (i.e. regulation 48).",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 15: Planned procurement notices",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 54: Time limits",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Prior information notices",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
